      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is due to compatibility code to load older asset bundles into Unity 2022. Once we release a 2022-compatible SDK, any worlds uploaded with that will automatically use the fast-path again and thus load scenes at the same speed (or faster) than before.\n\nFor now, we will increase the loading timeout, so you can still make your way into these worlds even if it takes a while.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
